  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Reported by Janna Wemekamp:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The REST API's 'findObjects' method will not return the 'format' column.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Eg.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects?format=xml&maxResults=9999999&pid=true&title=true&identifier=true&creator=true&subject=true&description=true&publisher=true&contributor=true&date=true&type=true&format=true&source=true&language=true&relation=true&coverage=true&rights=true&query=pid%3Duuid%3A2d9c3eaa-1f30-11de-a002-37af095b5cfc"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects?format=xml&maxResults=9999999&pid=true&title=true&identifier=true&creator=true&subject=true&description=true&publisher=true&contributor=true&date=true&type=true&format=true&source=true&language=true&relation=true&coverage=true&rights=true&query=pid%3Duuid%3A2d9c3eaa-1f30-11de-a002-37af095b5cfc",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "and",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects?format=html&maxResults=9999999&pid=true&title=true&identifier=true&creator=true&subject=true&description=true&publisher=true&contributor=true&date=true&type=true&format=true&source=true&language=true&relation=true&coverage=true&rights=true&query=pid%3Duuid%3A2d9c3eaa-1f30-11de-a002-37af095b5cfc"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/objects?format=html&maxResults=9999999&pid=true&title=true&identifier=true&creator=true&subject=true&description=true&publisher=true&contributor=true&date=true&type=true&format=true&source=true&language=true&relation=true&coverage=true&rights=true&query=pid%3Duuid%3A2d9c3eaa-1f30-11de-a002-37af095b5cfc",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "do not return the 'format' column even though it has values in the database.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Removing the 'format=xml' parameter returns something of type 'text/true' which looks like xml but isn't treated as such by the browser (FF3) and can't be parsed as xml. However it does contain the format values!",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This bug is a performance nuisance since the only way to retrieve ALL the DC values (via the REST API) is to use the 'getDatastreamDissemination' method. According to some quick tests, this is roughly 3 times slower than a direct query on the database using 'findObjects'.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
